{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-04-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR INC. MAINTAINS DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL. , APRIL 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) VOTED TODAY TO MAINTAIN THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF ONE DOLLAR AND ELEVEN CENTS ($1.11) PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE MAY 20, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 25, 2022.'}